Kallol Mondal, IIT Kanpur. Environmental Degradation of Materials, NPTEL 113104061. [Official course](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/113104061) · [Syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/113104061.pdf).

Work the complete relevant theory and examples during sustained service/degradation study, then the full primary method and alloy/environment case used in the research. Connect thermodynamic tendency, electrochemical/transport kinetics, microstructure, surface state, environment, load, and observations. A nominal alloy designation does not define performance in every environment.

